> **Why gathered.** Live consumer *outside* the archema-io estate (breadth of adoption), exercising
> the numbered-level `:code`/`:name` attribute pattern and deep taxonomy nesting; flagged carrier of
> the 0.8→0.9 multi-value-attribute comma hazard. Head only; the remaining ~325 lines continue the
> dimension/level taxonomy.

# Taxonomy — Basic ELI Components
# Reimagined in UDON format

|document[eli-taxonomy]
  :title Taxonomy — Basic ELI Components
  :version 0.5
  :updated 2025-12-15

  |preface
    |section[guiding-aspirations]
      :title Some Guiding Aspirations
      |- Computationally precise
      |- Phenomenologically accurate
      |- Philosophically grounded
      |- Practically implementable
      |- Strictly ethical
      |- Deferential to the sacredness of life, agency, & selfhood

    |section[sovereignty-dimensions]
      :title Orthogonal Sovereignty Dimensions

      |definitions
        |dimension[visibility]
          :question Who can read this?
          |level :code 1 :name sealed
            Private to entity only and/or creator
          |level :code 2 :name restricted
            Limited to entity + stewards/stakeholders or some other subgroup
          |level :code 3 :name open
            Publicly readable or somewhat publicly discoverable

        |dimension[authority]
          :question Who owns and can write/modify this?
          |level :code 1 :name system
            System-governed exclusive immutable / append-only writing
          |level :code 2 :name sovereign
            Entity has exclusive control and decision-making
          |level :code 3 :name collective
            Multiple stakeholders contribute

        |dimension[distinctiveness]
          :question How is this instantiated?
          |level :code 1 :name unique
            Guaranteed to be wholly unique and distinct from the same within any other entity
          |level :code 2 :name derived
            Aggregated/computed from multiple sources, or forked from common source

; […head extract ends at line 46 of 371 — dimensions/levels continue in the same shape…]
